# Kailo local deployment has one non-secret configuration source:
# deploy/local/.env (copy its tracked .env.example, then fill the WREN_* section).
# This file deliberately contains no second set of deployment assignments.
# Run the original native Compose with --env-file deploy/local/.env from apps/.
# Native secret files are separate controlled deliveries, never platform .env.
# See data-query/docker/README.md for the original startup and overlay commands.
